Package: HDZACP
Type: Package
Title: High-Dimensional Distributional Change-Point Inference
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: c(
    person("Ping", "Zhao", role = "aut"),
    person("Long", "Feng", email = "flnankai@nankai.edu.cn",
           role = c("aut", "cre"))
  )
Description: Implements the nonparametric high-dimensional distributional
    change-point procedures ZAS, ZAM, and ZAC. Coordinatewise likelihood-ratio
    rank scans are aggregated by a sum, a maximum, or an adaptive Cauchy
    combination and calibrated by whole-vector permutation. Single- and
    multiple-change estimation, analytic calibration utilities, competitors,
    simulations, and reproducible analyses from the accompanying article are
    provided. Empirical data are downloaded from their official repositories
    and are not included in the package.
